WEBVTT

00:03.800 --> 00:05.200
Your Highness is awake

00:14.480 --> 00:15.880
Your Highness

00:16.240 --> 00:17.640
I said before

00:18.400 --> 00:20.067
You may not trust me

00:21.280 --> 00:22.680
But I don't know

00:23.000 --> 00:24.880
What I might do

00:26.760 --> 00:28.760
If I still want to struggle

00:29.640 --> 00:31.520
I can only drag Your Highness

00:32.080 --> 00:34.413
To go mad with me this once

00:34.920 --> 00:35.640
Chen Wan'er

00:35.720 --> 00:37.120
You're mad

00:38.640 --> 00:40.040
Your Highness

00:40.720 --> 00:42.120
As a crown prince

00:42.520 --> 00:44.240
You have no way back

00:45.520 --> 00:47.000
Wan'er is helping you

00:48.160 --> 00:50.160
The entire Prince of Ning's residence

00:50.400 --> 00:51.760
Has been searching for us

00:51.920 --> 00:53.320
All night

00:53.400 --> 00:55.040
If they discover

00:55.520 --> 00:58.120
That on elder brother's wedding day

00:58.480 --> 01:00.880
You slept with your sister-in-law

01:01.040 --> 01:02.440
Do you think

01:02.760 --> 01:04.240
All the world

01:04.640 --> 01:06.120
Will see you?

01:06.800 --> 01:08.200
Prince of Jin

01:11.000 --> 01:12.320
Your Highness

01:12.400 --> 01:15.733
Do you want to be master of all under heaven?

01:17.240 --> 01:18.520
Chen Wan'er

01:18.600 --> 01:20.933
What exactly are you trying to say?

01:21.560 --> 01:23.893
The city gate commandant is your man

01:24.040 --> 01:25.000
The Xie family

01:25.120 --> 01:26.480
Also leans toward you

01:26.880 --> 01:28.400
As for the Chen family

01:28.480 --> 01:29.880
I'll find a way

01:30.120 --> 01:30.720
Taking advantage of the wedding

01:30.800 --> 01:32.200
When defenses are lax

01:32.360 --> 01:33.520
Your Highness

01:33.600 --> 01:35.280
As long as you seal the city gates

01:35.360 --> 01:36.760
And raise the call

01:37.280 --> 01:38.680
From then on

01:39.000 --> 01:40.400
You will be emperor

01:49.480 --> 01:50.800
Or

01:50.880 --> 01:52.040
You can also just

01:52.120 --> 01:53.520
Walk out boldly

01:53.760 --> 01:55.200
And let all the world

01:55.280 --> 01:57.280
See the Sikong family's disgrace
